// The range relationship read from the other side: salgrade first, then emp. The condition of
// fk_emp_salgrade is declared from emp to salgrade and is turned round (start and end swapped) for
// this direction. The rows are those of b07 without the department: employees per salary grade.
FIND salgrade s, s VIA same_grade emp e
FETCH s.grade ASC, agg(e.emp_count) empcount, agg(s.grade_count) gradecount
